# Optional: force API base URL (no trailing slash).
# - Dev (vite): if unset, uses http://<same-hostname-as-the-page>:8000 (LAN-friendly).
# - Prod (vite build): if unset, uses same-origin `/api/...` (matches nginx proxy in Dockerfile.prod).
#
# Phone on Wi‑Fi: open the app at http://YOUR_PC_LAN_IP:5173 (not localhost). Leave VITE_API_URL
# unset, or if you use http://localhost:8000 below, the app still switches to your PC's IP
# automatically when the page is not loaded from localhost.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
